sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant U as 用户
    participant DE as DrawerEditor(编辑器)
    participant DHS as DrawerHeaderStore(新)
    participant DB as Room库/Workspace镜像
    participant SPVM as ShellPreviewViewModel(预览)
    participant POL as UrlOpenPolicy(共享判定)
    participant NAV as MmaNavHost(事件消费)
    participant SYS as 系统浏览器
    participant TA as TemplateActivity(导出壳)
    participant WVS as WebViewScreen(双侧共享)

    rect rgb(235, 244, 255)
    Note over U,WVS: 场景A：④ fitToApp=false 的外链语义（预览侧）
    U->>SPVM: 点击抽屉菜单项(NavigateUrl)
    SPVM->>POL: resolveUrlOpenTarget(DRAWER_ITEM)
    POL-->>SPVM: EXTERNAL (fitToApp=false)
    SPVM->>NAV: ShellPreviewEvent.OpenExternal(url)
    NAV->>SYS: Intent.ACTION_VIEW
    Note over WVS: 页内链接分支：InAppWebViewClient 同判定→外跳；<br/>OpenLocalPage/顶栏tab/底栏恒内嵌(骨架)
    end

    rect rgb(240, 255, 240)
    Note over U,WVS: 场景B：④ 导出壳同分支（对称）
    U->>TA: 点击顶栏动作按钮(NavigateUrl)
    TA->>POL: resolveUrlOpenTarget(ACTION)
    POL-->>TA: EXTERNAL
    TA->>SYS: Intent.ACTION_VIEW（同一判定函数，双侧同源）
    end

    rect rgb(255, 248, 235)
    Note over U,DB: 场景C：⑨ 头图上传→落库→预览渲染
    U->>DE: 选择模式=图片，上传横图
    DE->>DHS: saveFromPicker(uri)
    DHS->>DHS: DrawerHeaderComposer 居中裁2:1→1024x512 PNG
    DHS-->>DE: filesDir/drawer/header-<uuid>.png
    DE->>DB: spec.drawer.headerMode=IMAGE, headerImageRef=绝对路径
    DB->>SPVM: 项目流重推(shellSpec含新字段)
    SPVM->>WVS: (图片由 ShellDrawerSection 经 DrawerHeaderImage 解码渲染，缺失→回落TEXT)
    end

    rect rgb(255, 240, 245)
    Note over U,DB: 场景D：⑨ 导出注入（参考 mma_pages 先例）
    DB->>DB: 导出 shell_spec.json + headerImageRef 指向的图
    DB->>TA: inject_shell_spec.py --header-image
    TA->>TA: 校验 headerMode/白名单 + 缺图拒绝(构建期拦截)
    TA->>TA: 写入 assets/mma_drawer_header.png(固定名)
    TA->>WVS: 运行期 DrawerHeaderImage 读 assets 解码<br/>(与预览同一渲染分支，判定对称)
    end
